.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-vpc-gateway-get - Get the VPC gateway


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro vpc gateway get  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Get the VPC gateway

.PP
The gateway gives private-only servers internet access (NAT), port forwarding and the inter-subnet rule. While it is on it is billed hourly from the prepaid balance (\fBmonthly_eur\fR / 672, at least 1 hour, never more than \fBmonthly_eur\fR a month) and needs at least one prepaid tr-ist-1 server on the account (409 \fBno_billing_server\fR). Turning it off releases its public IP; refused while port forwards exist, or while private-only servers use it (409 \fBgateway_in_use\fR, repeat with \fBallow_no_egress: true\fR). Outgoing connections are logged as required by Turkish Law No. 5651 (2 years).

.PP
API: GET /cloud/vpcs/{vpc_id}/gateway (operationId getVpcGateway, scope cloud_read)


